Each cell from ex-utero-cultured embryos was projected onto the WT atlas by matching its expression profile with the best-matching atlas metacell profile: Let ug,c be the single-cell gene expression matrix for all cells c> from ex utero cultured embryos and eg,m the WT atlas gene expression per metacell m for all genes g from a set of 581 feature genes. On the basis of the cell-metacell correlation matrix\documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
